### ODATA Service Entry Point

GET http://localhost:4004/service/ResilienceCockpitService
Authorization: Basic bob:bobpassword456

### Request to fetch Alternate Supplier List
GET http://localhost:4004/service/ResilienceCockpitService/AlternateSuppliers
Authorization: Basic bob:bobpassword456

### Request to fetch Alternate Supplier List in ODATA V2

GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v2/service/ResilienceCockpitService/AlternateSuppliers
Authorization: Basic bob:bobpassword456

### Request to fetch Alternate Supplier List with filtration
GET http://localhost:4004/service/ResilienceCockpitService/AlternateSuppliers?$filter=CountryCode eq 'IN'
Authorization: Basic bob:bobpassword456

### Read Specific Entity
GET http://localhost:4004/service/ResilienceCockpitService/AlternateSuppliers(ID=18605002-7328-4d21-866c-8de619a126eb,IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: Basic bob:bobpassword456

### Expansion of a Entity [ Supplier Parts]
GET http://localhost:4004/service/ResilienceCockpitService/AlternateSuppliers(ID=1860499b-117a-410a-ab4f-9753596c3641,IsActiveEntity=true)?$expand=SupplierParts

### Update Specific Entity , Property
